  "status": "present",
  "value": "As variant 3, plus an optional ;q=<value> quality per token (0..1, up to 3 decimals, default 1). Each supported tag takes the quality of its most specific matching token (exact tag > bare language > *; first such token if repeated). Tags with no matching token or quality 0 are excluded. Order by quality descending, then by the position of the earliest header token matching the tag at all, then supported-list order.",
